Step 1 · Screening · 1/4: Click "Open the records".

6
00:00:27.906 --> 00:00:32.915
Step 1 · Screening · 1/4: Pick a batch: here "41–60". Yours is "1–20".

7
00:00:32.915 --> 00:00:37.927
Step 1 · Screening · 1/4: Wait for "20 records ready": abstracts come from PubMed.

8
00:00:37.927 --> 00:00:43.126
Step 1 · Screening · 1/4: Click "Copy batch".

9
00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:48.331
Step 1 · Screening · 2/4: Back on the Start page: click "Copy the screening prompt".

10
00:00:48.331 --> 00:00:52.937
Step 1 · Screening · 2/4: Click "Show the screening prompt" to read it.

11
00:00:52.937 --> 00:00:57.950
Step 1 · Screening · 2/4: The prompt already contains criteria C1–C6.

12
00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:03.957
Step 1 · Screening · 3/4: Paste the prompt, then the records where it says [PASTE THE RECORDS HERE].

13
00:01:03.957 --> 00:01:09.134
Step 1 · Screening · 3/4: Use a new temporary chat, with web search off.

14
00:01:09.134 --> 00:01:13.540
Step 1 · Screening · 3/4: This is the AI's real answer, unedited.

15
00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:18.951
Step 1 · Screening · 3/4: One row per record: a decision and the criterion behind it.

16
00:01:18.951 --> 00:01:25.759
Step 1 · Screening · 3/4: Check the count first: 20 records in, 20 rows out.

17
00:01:25.759 --> 00:01:30.763
Step 1 · Screening · 4/4: Open the scorer and paste the AI's whole answer.

18
00:01:30.763 --> 00:01:35.069
Step 1 · Screening · 4/4: Press "Score my screening".

19
00:01:35.069 --> 00:01:40.478
Step 1 · Screening · 4/4: Coverage first: 20 of 60 screened, as expected for one batch.

20
00:01:40.478 --> 00:01:45.687
Step 1 · Screening · 4/4: Sensitivity 100%: no include missed. Then 4 false includes.

21
00:01:45.687 --> 00:01:49.291
Step 1 done: 20 records in, 20 rows out; Scored: 20 of 60 screened, 0 missed includes.

22
00:01:50.215 --> 00:01:55.226
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/3: Under the score: 0 missed includes, 4 false includes.

23
00:01:55.226 --> 00:02:00.635
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/3: All 4 were excluded by the review only after the full text.

24
00:02:00.635 --> 00:02:05.244
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/3: At title/abstract stage, these are not errors.

25
00:02:05.244 --> 00:02:10.248
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/3: Open "Going further": the title/abstract-stage view.

26
00:02:10.248 --> 00:02:15.053
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/3: Here 70%: the AI excluded R043, R046 and R054.

27
00:02:15.053 --> 00:02:19.859
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/3: The human screeners had sent those 3 to full text.

28
00:02:19.859 --> 00:02:25.281
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 1/3: The AI was stricter than the humans: check its excludes too.

29
00:02:25.281 --> 00:02:31.503
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/3: Open 2 of them: here R050 and R058.

30
00:02:31.503 --> 00:02:35.824
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/3: On the Records page, batch 3 again.

31
00:02:35.824 --> 00:02:40.830
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/3: R050: read the abstract, not only the AI's reason.

32
00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:46.639
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/3: Found: hospital-wide campaign, but infections measured only in the ICU.

33
00:02:46.639 --> 00:02:51.847
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/3: Decide: "unsure" was fair, C2 really is unclear here.

34
00:02:51.847 --> 00:02:57.264
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/3: The review excluded it after the full text: not an error now.

35
00:02:57.264 --> 00:03:02.271
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/3: R058: the AI said include, but flagged "check C3".

36
00:03:02.271 --> 00:03:07.277
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/3: Found: hospital-wide campaign, its components not described.

37
00:03:07.277 --> 00:03:12.286
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 2/3: Then contact precautions and chlorhexidine bathing were added.

38
00:03:12.286 --> 00:03:17.895
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/3: Decide: C3 is in doubt, so "unsure" fits the prompt better.

39
00:03:17.895 --> 00:03:23.507
Step 2 · Look at the errors · 3/3: Either way it goes to full text, where the review excluded it.

40
00:03:23.507 --> 00:03:27.111
Step 2 done: 4 false includes: excluded by the review only after the full text; 3 excludes stricter than the human screeners; Read the abstract, not the AI's reason.

41
