52
00:04:28.265 --> 00:04:33.872
Step 3 · Short extraction · 3/3: It is in Methods, a few lines up: check every number.

53
00:04:33.872 --> 00:04:39.283
Step 3 · Short extraction · 3/3: The quote-check script agrees: 6 of 6 quotes found verbatim.

54
00:04:39.283 --> 00:04:42.888
